    "created_at": "2019-05-22T23:06:07Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-05-28T18:50:57Z",
    "body": "We are trying to re-launch TextMetrics now. I think it might be too late for us to change names for these functions now. During the past few month, Safari has already launched TextMetrics API and they used these function names, i.e., actualBoundingBoxLeft, actualBoundingBoxRight, *Ascent and *Descent. \r\n\r\nWe don't support vertical text for now. I can add this on the spec.",
